    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shade Silver 2 A Walk In The Darkness is a game about a wizard trapped in a nightmare looking for an exit. He must stop his nightmares form becoming real and taking over reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >34 levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wider verity of game play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More horror like than the first</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New death animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New looks for Shade Silver </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harder and more fun mazes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Dreams AKA Nightmares Basically 2 Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to have nightmares and run for you life in a spellbinding Horror game made just for you. Shade Silver 2 A Walk In The Darkness is a new adventure to help you satisfy your cravings for Nightmares.</p>",
